	        {"geo":{"@type":"GeoCoordinates","latitude":"19.24626","longitude":"72.86044"},"image":"https://img.staticmb.com/mbimages/project/Photo_h310_w462/Project-Photo-3-Neev-Horizon-Mumbai-5047652_480_1366_310_462.jpg","address":{"addressCountry":"IN","@type":"PostalAddress","addressLocality":"Borivali West","addressRegion":"Mumbai"},"@type":"ApartmentComplex","name":"Neev Horizon","description":"Neev Horizon Price Rs. 2.0 Cr - 2.53 Cr Neev Horizon Status Ready To Move Towers in Neev Horizon 1 If you are searching for a premium home in Borivali West, Mumbai, Neev Horizon offers well designed properties in the price range of Rs. 2.0 Cr - 2.53 Cr. Developed by Neev Infrastructure, the project reflects quality construction and reliability. As of the latest update, the project is in the Ready To Move phase. The project includes 1 towers. Neev Horizon has not been granted its commencement certificate. Planning to invest in this exclusive property? You can visit the property at L. T. Road, Near T. B. Z. Showrrom, Borivali West, Mumbai, Maharashtra, India. . The pincode for this project is 400092. The project includes Intercom Facility, Vaastu Compliant facilities in the unit. Major amenities include Rain Water Harvesting, Lift, Park, Reserved Parking, Swimming Pool and more. Other facilities include Flower Gardens, Indoor Games Room, Kids Play Area, among others. Dotom Hilton, Kalpataru Advay, Inspira Aura, Nicco Vanashri, IM The Crimson are notable nearby under-construction projects. Shraddha Elite, Shanti Ashram, Paradigm Ananda Residency, Garden Grove Phase 2, Saath NHP W 92 stand out as nearby ready-to-move residential options. How is the Borivali West Real Estate Market? As recorded in the July 2026 quarter, multistorey apartments in Borivali West have an average price of Rs. 25,004/sq. ft, with properties typically priced between Rs. 18,991 and Rs. 31,016/sq. ft, accommodating varied buyer and investor segments. The rental yield for homes in Borivali West, Mumbai is currently 2.96%. As per 376 user reviews, Borivali West records an impressive rating of 4.16/5.For retail and entertainment, Maxus Cinemas and Zoom Plaza Mall are within easy reach. MKVV and St. Francis Institute of Technology are notable schools conveniently located within walking reach of the project.","@context":"https://schema.org","url":"https://www.magicbricks.com/neev-horizon-borivali-west-mumbai-pdpid-4d4235303437363532"}
	    </script>
	
	
