p__emiCal__count"><span class="rupee">₹</span>14294000</div><div class="pdp__emiCal__info"><div class="pdp__emiCal__color interest"></div>Total Interest</div><div class="pdp__emiCal__count"><span class="rupee">₹</span>20287689</div></div></div></div><div class="pdp__emiCal__why"><div class="pdp__emiCal__why--title">Why Magicbricks for Home Loan?</div><div class="pdp__emiCal__why--list"><div class="pdp__emiCal__why--item">Offers from 34+ Banks</div><div class="pdp__emiCal__why--item">Lowest Interest Rate</div><div class="pdp__emiCal__why--item">Highest Loan Value</div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="pdp__prjtour "><h2 class="pdp__prjtour--title">Neev Horizon<!-- --> Photos &amp; Videos</h2><div class="pdp__prjtour__reviews"><div class="pdp__prjtour__card shimmer"><img src="data:image/svg+xml;base64," data-src="https://img.staticmb.com/mbimages/project/Photo_h310_w462/Project-Photo-3-Neev-Horizon-Mumbai-5047652_480_1366_310_462.jpg" decoding="async" alt="Neev Horizon photos 1" title="Neev Horizon photos 1" width="100%" height="100%" class="pdp__prjtour--img customLazy"/></div><div class="pdp__prjtour__card shimmer"><img src="data:image/svg+xml;base64," data-src="https://img.staticmb.com/mbimages/project/Photo_h310_w462/Project-Photo-2-Neev-Horizon-Mumbai-5047652_664_452_310_462.jpg" decoding="async" alt="Project View in Neev Horizon" title="Project View in Neev Horizon" width="100%" height="100%" class="pdp__prjtour--img customLazy"/></div></div><div class="pdp__prjtour--seeAll ">See All Photos/Videos</div></div><div class="pdp__abloc pdp__section hasreport" id="nav-about-locality"><h2 class="pdp__abloc--locName">About<a href="https://www.magicbricks.com/Borivali-West-in-Mumbai-Overview" target="_blank"> <!-- -->Borivali West</a></h2><div class="pdp__abloc--topwrap"><div class="pdp__abloc--left shimmer"><div class="pdp__abloc__vidcard shimmer"><img src="data:image/svg+xml;base64," decoding="async" alt="Borivali West Video" title="Borivali West Video" width="100%" height="100%" class="pdp__abloc__vidcard--img customLazy"/><span class="pdp__videoIcon"></span></div></div><div class="pdp__abloc--right"><div class="pdp__abloc__ratingwrap"><div class="rating__bloc"><div class="rating"><span class="rating__count">4.2</span><ul class="pdp__projreview__ratestar"><li class="pdp__projreview__star full"></li><li class="pdp__projreview__star full"></li><li class="pdp__projreview__star full"></li><li class="pdp__projreview__star full"></li><li class="pdp__projreview__star half"></li></ul></div><div class="reviews">376<!-- --> reviews</div></div><div class="rank__bloc"><div class="rank__label">Rank</div><div class="rank__count"><span class="rank">133</span> out of <!-- -->3015<!-- --> localities <span class="info-icon"></span></div></div></div><div class="pdp__locavgprice"><div class="pdp__locavgprice__title">Locality Average Price</div><div class="pdp__locavgprice__price"><span class="rupee">₹</span> <!-- -->25003<!-- -->/sq.ft<span class="pdp__locavgprice__price--green"> + <span class="rupee">₹</span>640<!-- --> (<!-- -->2.6<!-- -->% <span class="pdp__locavgprice__price__toparrow"></span>)</span><span class="pdp__locavgprice__price--sm"> QoQ</span></div></div></div></div><div class="pdp__locintro"><div class="pdp__locintro__title">Locality introduction and neighbourhood</div><div class="pdp__locintro__des">Situated in the northern part of Mumbai, Borivali West is a developed residential suburb that majorly caters to the upper-mid segment. The locality is located along the Western lin...<!-- --> <span class="smole">Read More</span></div></div><div class="pdp__projthings"><div class="pdp__projthings__title">Things to keep in mind</div><ul class="pdp__projthings__list"><li class="pdp__projthings__list__val">Police patrolling during nights enhances security</li><li class="pdp__projthings__list__val">Ample presence of schools, hospitals, shopping centres, malls and banks, within the neighbourhood offers ease of living to its residents and makes it a preferred residential locality.</li><li class="pdp__projthings__list__val">Extensively connected with prominent areas of Mumbai and key employment centres through road and western suburban railway line. Upcoming metro Line 2 to further improve connectivity in the region.</li></ul></div><a class="pdp__cta outlined exporlocta fullwidth" href="https://www.magicbricks.com/Borivali-West-in-Mumbai-Overview" target="_blank">Explore Borivali West</a></div><div class="about-developer pdp__section " id="nav-about-builder"><h2 class="about-developer--title">About <!-- -->Neev Infrastructure</h2><div class="about-developer__wrap"><div><div class="about-developer__builder"><div class="about-developer__builder--logo"><img src="data:image/svg+xml;base64," data-src="https://img.staticmb.com/mbimages/photo_dir/developer/original_images/60413/Neev-Infrastructure-Pvt.-Ltd.-1395739209927-D.gif" decoding="async" alt="Neev Infrastructure" title="Neev Infrastructure" width="100%" height="100%" class="about-developer__builder--img customLazy"/></div><div class="about-developer__builder--info"><div class="about-developer__builder__heading"><a href="https://www.magicbricks.com/neev-infrastructure-buid-4d423630343133" target="_blank">Neev Infrastructure</a></div></div></div></div><div class="about-developer__table"><div class="about-developer__table--row"><div class="about-developer__table__item">Total Projects</div><div class="about-developer__table__item">14</div></div><div class="about-developer__table--row"><div class="about-developer__table__item">Projects Completed</div><div class="about-developer__table__item">9</div></div><div class="about-developer__table--row"><div class="about-developer__table__item">Projects Ongoing</div><div class="about-developer__table__item">5</div></div></div><div class="about-developer__actions"><span class="pdp__cta outlined exporbuilder">Explore Builder</span><span class="pdp__cta filled-red">Contact Seller</span></div></div><div class="about-developer__desc">&#x27;Neev&#x27; finds its roots of origination in the Hindi word meaning &#x27;foundation&#x27;. At Neev, we not only build the world, but lives too. The Neev group has ...<!-- --> <span class="readmore">Read More</span></div><div class="slidepopup aboutdeveloper "><div class="popup__header"><div class="popup__header__back"></div><div class="popup__header__title ellipsis">About Developer</div></div><div class="popup__body aboutdeveloper"><table><tbody><tr><td><div><div>&#x27;Neev&#x27; finds its roots of origination in the Hindi word meaning &#x27;foundation&#x27;. At Neev, we not only build the world, but lives too. The Neev group has always been making a difference in enriching the community it serves, by delivering high standards of living, working and infrastructure.</div><div><br/></div><div>Neev group was established under the able guidance of industry veteran, Mr. Chandulal V Jain in 1978, who envisioned a future with a difference, built on trust, innovation, values and commitment.</div><div><br/></div><div>In order to achieve organizational excellence there are two dedicated business verticals to handle different facets of the business, real estate and infrastructure. In the real estate vertical, having completed 2.1 million sq. feet of projects, and another 4.5 million sq. feet of work in progress, Neev Homes is a leading player in the residential space.</div><div><br/></div><div>Over the years Neev Infrastructure has made its mark in the areas of urban infrastructure, industrial infrastructure, water &amp; environment and transportation and is now set to enter progressive sectors like tourism. While we&#x27;ve carried out challenging projects in the last 30 years, we&#x27;ve also been reputed with doing the same in the shortest span of time.</div><div><br/></div><div>To carry out our unique quest of making a difference to countless lives, we have a skilled team of difference-makers as well. Each of our employees is skilled in his/her discipline, with a willingness to transform the world into a better place.</div><div><br/></div><div>The trust, togetherness and loyalty which Neev inspires are deeply ingrained in our philosophy and shall continue to grow in the future.</div></div></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div><div class="pdp__hibnr"><div class="pdp__hibnr__container shimmer" style="height:200px;border:none"><a href="https://property.magicbricks.com/microsite/lp/patabadlolifebadlo/?inc=pblb_web_pdp_pblbbanner_belowhibannere" target="_blank" aria-label="Pata Badlo Life Badlo Offer Banner"><img src="data:image/svg+xml;base64," data-src="https://cdn.staticmb.com/pdpstatic/images/magic-Interior_878-x-403.jpg" decoding="async" alt="Pata Badlo Life Badlo Offer Banner" title="Pata Badlo Life Badlo Offer Banner" width="100%" height="100%" class="pdp__hibnr--img customLazy"/></a></div></div><div class="pdp__similar pdp__section" id="nav-similar-projects"><div class="pdp__similar__header"><div class="pdp__similar__headerlabel">If you like <!-- -->Neev Horizon<!-- -->,</div><div class="pdp__similar__headermain">Don&#x27;t miss <span class="pdp__similar__headermain-gray">these similar projects</span> <span class="pdp__similar__mhlogo"><div class="animated-MHLogo"><div class="animated-MHLogo__inner"><img src="data:image/svg+xml;base64," data-src="https://cdn.staticmb.com/pdpstatic/images/logo-magic-homes-animation.svg" decoding="async" alt="" title="" width="100%" height="100%" class="animated-MHLogo__icon customLazy"/></div></div></span></div></div><div class="pdp__similar__blocks"><div class="swiper-button-prev" id="smiliarprj-arrow-prev"></div><div class="swiper-button-next" id="smiliarprj-arrow-next"></div><div class="swiper"><div class="swiper-wrapper pdp__similar__swiper"><div class="swiper-slide"><div class="pdp__similar__block shimmer"><div class="pdp__similar__infocont"><div class="pdp__similar__imageblock"><img src="data:image/svg+xml;base64," data-src="https://img.staticmb.com/mbimages/pro