otom-hilton-borivali-west-mumbai-pdpid-4d4235343139393831' target='_blank'>Dotom Hilton</a>, <a href='https://www.magicbricks.com/sumit-kmr-param-borivali-west-mumbai-pdpid-4d4235343234303535' target='_blank'>Sumit KMR Param</a>, <a href='https://www.magicbricks.com/nicco-vanashri-borivali-west-mumbai-pdpid-4d4235343236343639' target='_blank'>Nicco Vanashri</a>, <a href='https://www.magicbricks.com/kalpataru-advay-borivali-west-mumbai-pdpid-4d4235343232383333' target='_blank'>Kalpataru Advay</a> and <a href='https://www.magicbricks.com/im-the-crimson-borivali-west-mumbai-pdpid-4d4235343433373835' target='_blank'>IM The Crimson</a> are other popular residential projects near Neev Horizon.
</div></div><div class="pdp__faq__quelist"><h3 class="pdp__faq__que">Which is nearest bus stop to Neev Horizon?</h3><div class="pdp__faq__ans">Poisar Depot Bus Stop is located near to the Neev Horizon. It is the only nearest bus stop & is located at a distance of 2.3 Kms.</div></div><div class="pdp__faq__quelist seo-hide-info"><h3 class="pdp__faq__que">How many towers in Neev Horizon?</h3><div class="pdp__faq__ans">Neev Horizon has a total of 1 towers in different unit configurations.</div></div><div class="pdp__faq__quelist seo-hide-info"><h3 class="pdp__faq__que">Where can I download the brochure PDF of Neev Horizon from?
</h3><div class="pdp__faq__ans">You can <a class='srp_qna_list' href='https://www.magicbricks.com/neev-horizon-borivali-west-mumbai-pdpid-4d4235303437363532#nav-overview' target='_blank'>download the brochure of Neev Horizon</a> visiting the Project page. </div></div><div class="pdp__faq__quelist seo-hide-info"><h3 class="pdp__faq__que">What is the area pin code of Neev Horizon?</h3><div class="pdp__faq__ans">The pin code for Neev Horizon in Borivali West, Mumbai is 400092.</div></div><div class="pdp__faq__quelist seo-hide-info"><h3 class="pdp__faq__que">Which is nearest metro station to Neev Horizon?</h3><div class="pdp__faq__ans">The nearest metro station to Neev Horizon is Borivali (West) Metro Station. It is 1.6 Kms away from Neev Horizon.</div></div><div class="pdp__faq__showmore"><div class="pdp__faq__showmore-link">Show more</div></div></div></div></div><div class="pdp__updatedon"><div class="pdp__updatedon__icon">i</div><div class="pdp__updatedon__text">This project was last updated on  <span class="text-semibold">07 September 2026</span></div></div><div class="pdp__popo "><div class="pdp__popo__popular"><div class="pdp__popo__blocks"><div class="pdp__popo__header">Quick Links</div><ul class="pdp__popo__seolinks "><li class="pdp__popo__seolink"><a href="https://www.magicbricks.com/neev-horizon-amenities-borivali-west-mumbai-pdpid-4d4235303437363532" class="pdp__popo__seourl underline" target="_blank">Neev Horizon Amenities</a></li><li class="pdp__popo__seolink"><a href="https://www.magicbricks.com/neev-horizon-location-borivali-west-mumbai-pdpid-4d4235303437363532" class="pdp__popo__seourl underline" target="_blank">Neev Horizon Location</a></li><li class="pdp__popo__seolink"><a href="https://www.magicbricks.com/neev-horizon-photo-videos-borivali-west-mumbai-pdpid-4d4235303437363532" class="pdp__popo__seourl underline" target="_blank">Neev Horizon Photos Videos</a></li></ul></div></div><div class="pdp__popo__othersblock"><div class="swiper-button-prev" id="s