ories-arrow-prev"></div><div class="swiper-button-next" id="poplrStories-arrow-next"></div><div class="swiper"><div class="swiper-wrapper pdp__psa__swiper"><div class="swiper-slide"><a href="https://www.magicbricks.com/blog/metro-line-3-mumbai/130855.html" target="_blank" class="pdp__psa__lst__itm swiper-slide"><div class="pdp__psa__lst__itm__scrn"><img src="data:image/svg+xml;base64," data-src="https://img.staticmb.com/mbcontent/images/crop/uploads/2023/1/metro-line-3-mumbai_300_450.jpg" decoding="async" alt="Mumbai Metro Line 3 Route Map, Stations, &amp; Opening Status | Aqua Line Metro Mumbai" title="Mumbai Metro Line 3 Route Map, Stations, &amp; Opening Status | Aqua Line Metro Mumbai" width="100%" height="100%" class="pdp__psa__lst__itm__scrn--img customLazy"/></div><div class="pdp__psa__lst__itm__txt"><div class="pdp__psa__lst__itm__txt--title">Mumbai Metro Line 3 Route Map, Stations, &amp; Opening Status | Aqua Line Metro Mumbai</div><div class="pdp__psa__lst__itm__txt--desc">Mumbai Metro Line 3 is 33.5 km long, spanning from Cuffe Parade to Aarey Colony, and comprises 27 stations. The third phase of the metro route became operational on October 08, 2025. Read to know more.</div></div></a></div><div class="swiper-slide"><a href="https://www.magicbricks.com/blog/mumbai-metro/127715.html" target="_blank" class="pdp__psa__lst__itm swiper-slide"><div class="pdp__psa__lst__itm__scrn"><img src="data:image/svg+xml;base64," data-src="https://img.staticmb.com/mbcontent/images/crop/uploads/2023/3/Mumbai-Metro-_300_450.jpg" decoding="async" alt="Mumbai Metro 2026: Route, Map, Stations List, Lines, News" title="Mumbai Metro 2026: Route, Map, Stations List, Lines, News" width="100%" height="100%" class="pdp__psa__lst__itm__scrn--img customLazy"/></div><div class="pdp__psa__lst__itm__txt"><div class="pdp__psa__lst__itm__txt--title">Mumbai Metro 2026: Route, Map, Stations List, Lines, News</div><div class="pdp__psa__lst__itm__txt--desc">Mumbai Metro kick started in 2006 with an aim to improve the connectivity in Mumbai Metropolitan Region. Follow this blog to know about the routes and stations of Mumbai Metro network.</div></div></a></div><div class="swiper-slide"><a href="https://www.magicbricks.com/blog/celeb-homes-salman-khan-house/125451.html" target="_blank" class="pdp__psa__lst__itm swiper-slide"><div class="pdp__psa__lst__itm__scrn"><img src="data:image/svg+xml;base64," data-src="https://img.staticmb.com/mbcontent/images/crop/uploads/2021/11/inside-salman-khan-house-galaxy_300_450.jpg" decoding="async" alt="Salman Khan House in Galaxy Apartments Bandra - Mumbai" title="Salman Khan House in Galaxy Apartments Bandra - Mumbai" width="100%" height="100%" class="pdp__psa__lst__itm__scrn--img customLazy"/></div><div class="pdp__psa__lst__itm__txt"><div class="pdp__psa__lst__itm__txt--title">Salman Khan House in Galaxy Apartments Bandra - Mumbai</div><div class="pdp__psa__lst__itm__txt--desc">The &#x27;Bhai&#x27; of Bollywood, Salman Khan is an avid investor. While he enjoys a grounded lifestyle, he owns many properties that add to his net worth. Check out Salman Khan&#x27;s house in Galaxy Apartments and other places.</div></div></a></div><div class="swiper-slide"><a href="https://www.magicbricks.com/blog/harbour-line-mumbai/131092.html" target="_blank" class="pdp__psa__lst__itm swiper-slide"><div class="pdp__psa__lst__itm__scrn"><img src="data:image/svg+xml;base64," data-src="https://img.staticmb.com/mbcontent/images/crop/uploads/2023/2/harbour-line-mumbai_300_450.jpg" decoding="async" alt="Harbour Line Mumbai Stations - Route, Map, Timings, Fare &amp; More" title="Harbour Line Mumbai Stations - Route, Map, Timings, Fare &amp; More" width="100%" height="100%" class="pdp__psa__lst__itm__scrn--img customLazy"/></div><div class="pdp__psa__lst__itm__txt"><div class="pdp__psa__lst__itm__txt--title">Harbour Line Mumbai Stations - Route, Map, Timings, Fare &amp; More</div><div class="pdp__psa__lst__itm__txt--desc">This blog delves into one of the three lines of Mumbai local trains -the Harbour Line Mumbai. The Harbour Line splits into two from Wadala Road, with one line heading to Navi Mumbai and another to Goregaon. Learn more. </div></div></a></div><div class="swiper-slide"><a href="https://www.magicbricks.com/blog/central-line-mumbai/131048.html" target="_blank" class="pdp__psa__lst__itm swiper-slide"><div class="pdp__psa__lst__itm__scrn"><img src="data:image/svg+xml;base64," data-src="https://img.staticmb.com/mbcontent/images/crop/uploads/2023/2/central-line-mumbai_300_450.jpg" decoding="async" alt="Central Line Mumbai - Route, Map, Station, Timings, Fare &amp; More" title="Central Line Mumbai - Route, Map, Station, Timings, Fare &amp; More" width="100%" height="100%" class="pdp__psa__lst__itm__scrn--img customLazy"/></div><div class="pdp__psa__lst__itm__txt"><div class="pdp__psa__lst__itm__txt--title">Central Line Mumbai - Route, Map, Station, Timings, Fare &amp; More</div><div class="pdp__psa__lst__itm__txt--desc">The Mumbai Central Line is a very vital suburban railway network within the city, with routes from CSMT to Kalyan, Kasara and Khopoli. Learn the details regarding the routes, stations, train timings, fare structure and interchange points.</div></div></a></div><div class="swiper-slide"><a href="https://www.magicbricks.com/blog/versova-ghatkopar-metro-route/131129.html" target="_blank" class="pdp__psa__lst__itm swiper-slide"><div class="pdp__psa__lst__itm__scrn"><img src="data:image/svg+xml;base64," data-src="https://img.staticmb.com/mbcontent/images/crop/uploads/2023/2/versova-ghatkopar-metro-route_300_450.jpg" decoding="async" alt="Mumbai Versova Ghatkopar Metro Route: Map, Stations &amp; More | Mumbai Line 1 - Blue Line" title="Mumbai Versova Ghatkopar Metro Route: Map, Stations &amp; More | Mumbai Line 1 - Blue Line" width="100%" height="100%" class="pdp__psa__lst__itm__scrn--img customLazy"/></div><div class="pdp__psa__lst__itm__txt"><div class="pdp__psa__lst__itm__txt--title">Mumbai Versova Ghatkopar Metro Route: Map, Stations &amp; More | Mumbai Line 1 - Blue Line</div><div class="pdp__psa__lst__itm__txt--desc">Versova Ghatkopar Metro Route, or the Mumbai Metro Line 1, connects the central and western suburbs. The Mumbai metro Line 1 is fully operational and was one of the first lines to be operational in Mumbai. Know more about Versova Andheri Ghatkopar Metro  - also called the Reliance Metro.</div></div></a></div><div class="swiper-slide"><a href="https://www.magicbricks.com/blog/yellow-line-metro-route-mumbai/130113.html" target="_blank" class="pdp__psa__lst__itm swiper-slide"><div class="pdp__psa__lst__itm__scrn"><img src="data:image/svg+xml;base64," data-src="https://img.staticmb.com/mbcontent/images/crop/uploads/2023/4/yellow-line-mumbai-metro-2A_300_450.jpg" decoding="async" alt="Yellow Line Metro Route of Mumbai | Line 2A &amp; Line 2B" title="Yellow Line Metro Route of Mumbai | Line 2A &amp; Line 2B" width="100%" height="100%" class="pdp__psa__lst__itm__scrn--img customLazy"/></div><div class="pdp__psa__lst__itm__txt"><div class="pdp__psa__lst__itm__txt--title">Yellow Line Metro Route of Mumbai | Line 2A &amp; Line 2B</div><div class="pdp__psa__lst__itm__txt--desc">The Mumbai Metro Yellow line is segmented into two parts, i.e. line 2A and 2B. The Line 2B has recently become partially operational.</div></div></a></div><div class="swiper-slide"><a href="https://www.magicbricks.com/blog/western-line-mumbai/131117.html" target="_blank" class="pdp__psa__lst__itm swiper-slide"><div class="pdp__psa__lst__itm__scrn"><img src="data:image/svg+xml;base64," data-src="https://img.staticmb.com/mbcontent/images/crop/uploads/2023/2/western-line-Mumbai_300_450.jpg" decoding="async" alt="Western Line Mumbai - Route, Map, Stations, Facilities, Fare &amp; More" title="Western Line Mumbai - Route, Map, Stations, Facilities, Fare &amp; More" width="100%" height="100%" class="pdp__psa__lst__itm__scrn--img customLazy"/></div><div class="pdp__psa__lst__itm__txt"><div class="pdp__psa__lst__itm__txt--title">Western Line Mumbai - Route, Map, Stations, Facilities, Fare &amp; More</div><div class="pdp__psa__lst__itm__txt--desc">The local train network of Mumbai is the heart of the city. In this vast network, Western Line Mumbai is one of the most important railway lines. This blog provides a deeper look into this railway line. </div></div></a></div></div></div></div><div class="pdp__psa__lst "><div class="swiper-button-prev" id="poplrStories-arrow-prev"></div><div class="swiper-button-next" id="poplrStories-arrow-next"></div><div class="swiper"><div class="swiper-wrapper pdp__psa__swiper"><div class="swiper-slide"><a href="https://www.magicbricks.com/blog/which-city-should-hnis-invest-in-luxury-property-jymb/151181.html" target="_blank" class="pdp__psa__lst__itm swiper-slide"><div class="pdp__psa__lst__itm__scrn"><img src="data:image/svg+xml;base64," data-src="https://img.staticmb.com/mbcontent/images/crop/uploads/2026/8/FI-mumbai-vs-delhi-bengaluru_300_450.jpg" decoding="async" alt="Mumbai vs Bengaluru vs Delhi-NCR: Where Should HNIs Invest in Luxury Property?" title="Mumbai vs Bengaluru vs Delhi-NCR: Where Should HNIs Invest in Luxury Property?" width="100%" height="100%" class="pdp__psa__lst__itm__scrn--img customLazy"/></div><div class="pdp__psa__lst__itm__txt"><div class="pdp__psa__lst__itm__txt--title">Mumbai vs Bengaluru vs Delhi-NCR: Where Should HNIs Invest in Luxury Property?</div><div class="pdp__psa__lst__itm__txt--desc">India&#x27;s luxury housing market is set to nearly double by 2031 but not every city offers the same opportunity. Here&#x27;s a real estate investment guide for HNIs in 2026 and why it matters.</div></div></a></div><div class="swiper-slide"><a href="https://www.magicbricks.com/blog/ready-rekoner-rates-in-mumbai/118403.html" target="_blank" class="pdp__psa__lst__itm swiper-slide"><div class="pdp__psa__lst__itm__scrn"><img src="data:image/svg+xml;base64," data-src="https://img.staticmb.com/mbco