"minRentPrice":null,"maxRentPrice":null,"minSalePrice":20420000,"maxSalePrice":24980000,"minPriceDesc":"2.04 Cr","maxPriceDesc":"2.49 Cr","psmLastModiDate":"07 September 2026","keyValueChange":"[{\"22381\":{\"dateChanged\":\"Sep 7, 2026\",\"new\":\"2.042E7-2.498E7\",\"old\":\"2.005E7-2.539E7\"}},{\"22388\":{\"dateChanged\":\"Dec 23, 2025\",\"new\":\"0\"}},{\"22389\":{\"dateChanged\":\"Dec 23, 2025\",\"new\":\"0\"}},{\"22382\":{\"dateChanged\":\"Dec 23, 2025\",\"new\":\"0\"}},{\"22386\":{\"dateChanged\":\"Dec 23, 2025\",\"new\":\"10068\"}},{\"22390\":{\"dateChanged\":\"Dec 23, 2025\",\"new\":\"0\"}},{\"22383\":{\"dateChanged\":\"Sep 19, 2025\",\"old\":\"0\"}}]","reraValidity":null},"projectDescription":{"projectId":"5047652","readMoreFlag":null,"shortDesc":null,"fullDesc":" \u003Ctable\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ENeev Horizon Price\u003C\u002Ftd\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ERs. 2.0 Cr - 2.53 Cr\u003C\u002Ftd\u003E\u003C\u002Ftr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ENeev Horizon Status\u003C\u002Ftd\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EReady To Move\u003C\u002Ftd\u003E\u003C\u002Ftr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ETowers in Neev Horizon\u003C\u002Ftd\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E1\u003C\u002Ftd\u003E\u003C\u002Ftr\u003E\u003C\u002Ftbody\u003E\u003C\u002Ftable\u003E If you are searching for a premium home in Borivali West, Mumbai, Neev Horizon offers well designed properties in the price range of Rs. 2.0 Cr - 2.53 Cr. Developed by Neev Infrastructure, the project reflects quality construction and reliability. As of the latest update, the project is in the Ready To Move phase. The project includes 1 towers. Neev Horizon has not been granted its commencement certificate. Planning to invest in this exclusive property? You can visit the property at L. T. Road, Near T. B. Z. Showrrom, Borivali West, Mumbai, Maharashtra, India. . The pincode for this project is 400092.  The project includes Intercom Facility, Vaastu Compliant facilities in the unit. Major amenities include Rain Water Harvesting, Lift, Park, Reserved Parking, Swimming Pool and more. Other facilities include Flower Gardens, Indoor Games Room, Kids Play Area, among others. Dotom Hilton, Kalpataru Advay, Inspira Aura, Nicco Vanashri, IM The Crimson are notable nearby under-construction projects. Shraddha Elite, Shanti Ashram, Paradigm Ananda Residency, Garden Grove Phase 2, Saath NHP W 92 stand out as nearby ready-to-move residential options.\u003Cbr\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E \u003Ch3\u003EHow is the Borivali West Real Estate Market?\u003C\u002Fh3\u003E As recorded in the July 2026 quarter, multistorey apartments in Borivali West have an average price of Rs. 25,004\u002Fsq. ft, with properties typically priced between Rs. 18,991 and Rs. 31,016\u002Fsq. ft, accommodating varied buyer and investor segments. The rental yield for homes in Borivali West, Mumbai is currently 2.96%. As per 376 user reviews, Borivali West records an impressive rating of 4.16\u002F5.For retail and entertainment, Maxus Cinemas and Zoom Plaza Mall are within easy reach. MKVV and St. Francis Institute of Technology are notable schools conveniently located within walking reach of the project.\u003Cbr\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E "},"projectSpecificationList":{"flooringDetail":{},"fittingDetail":{},"wallsDetail":{}},"projectDeveloperList":{"developerName":"Neev Infrastructure","developerExp":0,"projectCount":0,"readMoreFlag":null,"shortDesc":null,"fullDesc":"\u003Cdiv\u003E\u003Cdiv\u003E'Neev' finds its roots of origination in the Hindi word meaning 'foundation'. At Neev, we not only build the world, but lives too. The Neev group has always been making a difference in enriching the community it serves, by delivering high standards of living, working and infrastructure.\u003C\u002Fdiv\u003E\u003Cdiv\u003E\u003Cbr \u002F\u003E\u003C\u002Fdiv\u003E\u003Cdiv\u003ENeev group was established under the able guidance of industry veteran, Mr. Chandulal V Jain in 1978, who envisioned a future with a difference, built on trust, innovation, values and commitment.\u003C\u002Fdiv\u003E\u003Cdiv\u003E\u003Cbr \u002F\u003E\u003C\u002Fdiv\u003E\u003Cdiv\u003EIn order to achieve organizational excellence there are two dedicated business verticals to handle different facets of the business, real estate and infrastructure. In the real estate vertical, having completed 2.1 million sq. feet of projects, and another 4.5 million sq. feet of work in progress, Neev Homes is a leading player in the residential space.\u003C\u002Fdiv\u003E\u003Cdiv\u003E\u003Cbr \u002F\u003E\u003C\u002Fdiv\u003E\u003Cdiv\u003EOver the years Neev Infrastructure has made its mark in the areas of urban infrastructure, industrial infrastructure, water &amp; environment and transportation and is now set to enter progressive sectors like tourism. While we've carried out challenging projects in the last 30 years, we've also been reputed with doing the same in the shortest span of time.\u003C\u002Fdiv\u003E\u003Cdiv\u003E\u003Cbr \u002F\u003E\u003C\u002Fdiv\u003E\u003Cdiv\u003ETo carry out our unique quest of making a difference to countless lives, we have a skilled team of difference-makers as well. Each of our employees is skilled in his\u002Fher discipline, with a willingness to transform the world into a better place.\u003C\u002Fdiv\u003E\u003Cdiv\u003E\u003Cbr \u002F\u003E\u003C\u002Fdiv\u003E\u003Cdiv\u003EThe trust, togetherness and loyalty which Neev inspires are deeply ingrained in our philosophy and shall continue to grow in the future.\u003C\u002Fdiv\u003E\u003C\u002Fdiv\u003E","sinceInfo":"0","logo":"https:\u002F\u002Fimg.staticmb.com\u002Fmbimages\u002Fphoto_dir\u002Fdeveloper\u002Foriginal_images\u002F60413\u002FNeev-Infrastructure-Pvt.-Ltd.-1395739209927-D.gif","builderUrl":"neev-infrastructure-buid-4d423630343133","devTotalProj":"14","devCompProj":"9","devOngoingProj":"5","devCities":["Mumbai","Agra"],"devCityIds":"4320,5931","devCorpAddress":null,"devUnderCnstProj":"4"},"devid":"60413","ratingBean":{"waterRt":0,"electricityRt":0,"bac