0+0000","authorid":94474,"featuredImageUrl":"\u002Fimages\u002Fuploads\u002F2023\u002F1\u002Fmetro-line-3-mumbai.jpg","createdDate":"2023-01-20T17:55:33.000+0000","authorName":"Vipra Chadha","authorURL":"authors\u002Fvipra-chadha\u002F94474.html","domainName":"MBC","id":130855,"viewCount":903312,"category":14817,"excerpt":"Mumbai Metro Line 3 is 33.5 km long, spanning from Cuffe Parade to Aarey Colony, and comprises 27 stations. The third phase of the metro route became operational on October 08, 2025. Read to know more.","permalink":"https:\u002F\u002Fcontent.magicbricks.com\u002Fcity-news\u002Fmumbai-mmr\u002Fmetro-line-3-mumbai\u002F130855.html","slug":"metro-line-3-mumbai","subcategoryName":"Mumbai MMR","parentCategoryName":"City News","_version_":1875691300321230800,"url":"https:\u002F\u002Fwww.magicbricks.com\u002Fblog\u002Fmetro-line-3-mumbai\u002F130855.html"},{"articleTitle":"Mumbai Metro 2026: Route, Map, Stations List, Lines, News","topStory":"false","publishDate":"2026-01-29T13:00:00.000+0000","updatedDate":"2026-08-19T12:03:03.000+0000","authorid":89012,"featuredImageUrl":"\u002Fimages\u002Fuploads\u002F2023\u002F3\u002FMumbai-Metro-.jpg","createdDate":"2022-03-10T17:02:39.000+0000","authorName":"Anirudh Singh Chauhan","authorURL":"authors\u002Fanirudh-singh-chauhan\u002F89012.html","domainName":"MBC","id":127715,"viewCount":465661,"category":14818,"excerpt":"Mumbai Metro kick started in 2006 with an aim to improve the connectivity in Mumbai Metropolitan Region. Follow this blog to know about the routes and stations of Mumbai Metro network.","permalink":"https:\u002F\u002Fcontent.magicbricks.com\u002Fresearch\u002Fanalysis-insights\u002Fmumbai-metro\u002F127715.html","slug":"mumbai-metro","subcategoryName":"Analysis & Insights","parentCategoryName":"Research","_version_":1875691286935109600,"url":"https:\u002F\u002Fwww.magicbricks.com\u002Fblog\u002Fmumbai-metro\u002F127715.html"},{"articleTitle":"Salman Khan House in Galaxy Apartments Bandra - Mumbai","topStory":"false","publishDate":"2026-06-30T16:00:00.000+0000","updatedDate":"2026-07-19T17:52:40.000+0000","authorid":88516,"featuredImageUrl":"\u002Fimages\u002Fuploads\u002F2021\u002F11\u002Finside-salman-khan-house-galaxy.jpg","createdDate":"2021-11-24T16:58:26.000+0000","authorName":"Steffi Joseph","authorURL":"authors\u002Fsteffi-joseph\u002F88516.html","domainName":"MBC","id":125451,"viewCount":172729,"category":14832,"excerpt":"The 'Bhai' of Bollywood, Salman Khan is an avid investor. While he enjoys a grounded lifestyle, he owns many properties that add to his net worth. Check out Salman Khan's house in Galaxy Apartments and other places.","permalink":"https:\u002F\u002Fcontent.magicbricks.com\u002Flifestyle\u002Fceleb-homes\u002Fceleb-homes-salman-khan-house\u002F125451.html","slug":"celeb-homes-salman-khan-house","subcategoryName":"Celeb Homes","parentCategoryName":"Lifestyle","_version_":1875691284782383000,"url":"https:\u002F\u002Fwww.magicbricks.com\u002Fblog\u002Fceleb-homes-salman-khan-house\u002F125451.html"},{"articleTitle":"Harbour Line Mumbai Stations - Route, Map, Timings, Fare & More","topStory":"false","publishDate":"2025-11-19T07:00:00.000+0000","updatedDate":"2026-01-14T18:22:49.000+0000","authorid":88760,"featuredImageUrl":"\u002Fimages\u002Fuploads\u002F2023\u002F2\u002Fharbour-line-mumbai.jpg","createdDate":"2023-02-15T22:00:02.000+0000","authorName":"Namrata Naha","authorURL":"authors\u002Fnamrata-naha\u002F88760.html","domainName":"MBC","id":131092,"viewCount":159615,"category":14817,"excerpt":"This blog delves into one of the three lines of Mumbai local trains -the Harbour Line Mumbai. The Harbour Line splits into two from Wadala Road, with one line heading to Navi Mumbai and another to Goregaon. Learn more. ","permalink":"https:\u002F\u002Fcontent.magicbricks.com\u002Fcity-news\u002Fmumbai-mmr\u002Fharbour-line-mumbai\u002F131092.html","slug":"harbour-line-mumbai","subcategoryName":"Mumbai MMR","parentCategoryName":"City News","_version_":1875691286206349300,"url":"https:\u002F\u002Fwww.magicbricks.com\u002Fblog\u002Fharbour-line-mumbai\u002F131092.html"},{"articleTitle":"Central Line Mumbai - Route, Map, Station, Timings, Fare & More","topStory":"false","publishDate":"2025-04-01T14:37:00.000+0000","updatedDate":"2025-04-01T16:54:37.000+0000","authorid":88760,"featuredImageUrl":"\u002Fimages\u002Fuploads\u002F2023\u002F2\u002Fcentral-line-mumbai.jpg","createdDate":"2023-02-10T14:59:59.000+0000","authorName":"Namrata Naha","authorURL":"authors\u002Fnamrata-naha\u002F88760.html","domainName":"MBC","id":131048,"viewCount":142000,"category":14817,"excerpt":"The Mumbai Central Line is a very vital suburban railway network within the city, with routes from CSMT to Kalyan, Kasara and Khopoli. Learn the details regarding the routes, stations, train timings, fare structure and interchange points.","permalink":"https:\u002F\u002Fcontent.magicbricks.com\u002Fcity-news\u002Fmumbai-mmr\u002Fcentral-line-mumbai\u002F131048.html","slug":"central-line-mumbai","subcategoryName":"Mumbai MMR","parentCategoryName":"City News","_version_":1875691286204252200,"url":"https:\u002F\u002Fwww.magicbricks.com\u002Fblog\u002Fcentral-line-mumbai\u002F131048.html"},{"articleTitle":"Mumbai Versova Ghatkopar Metro Route: Map, Stations & More | Mumbai Line 1 - Blue Line","topStory":"false","publishDate":"2025-11-06T15:00:00.000+0000","updatedDate":"2026-01-14T21:07:50.000+0000","authorid":93416,"featuredImageUrl":"\u002Fimages\u002Fuploads\u002F2023\u002F2\u002Fversova-ghatkopar-metro-route.jpg","createdDate":"2023-02-20T12:42:46.000+0000","authorName":"Anuja Patil","authorURL":"authors\u002Fanuja-patil\u002F93416.html","domainName":"MBC","id":131129,"viewCount":132761,"category":14817,"excerpt":"Versova Ghatkopar Metro Route, or the Mumbai Metro Line 1, connects the central and western suburbs. The Mumbai metro Line 1 is fully operational and was one of the first lines to be operational in Mumbai. Know more about Versova Andheri Ghatkopar Metro  - also called the Reliance Metro.","permalink":"https:\u002F\u002Fcontent.magicbricks.com\u002Fcity-news\u002Fmumbai-mmr\u002Fversova-ghatkopar-metro-route\u002F131129.html","slug":"versova-ghatkopar-metro-route","subcategoryName":"Mumbai MMR","parentCategoryName":"City News","_version_":1875691294148264000,"url":"https:\u002F\u002Fwww.magicbricks.com\u002Fblog\u002Fversova-ghatkopar-metro-route\u002F131129.html"},{"articleTitle":"Yellow Line Metro Route of Mumbai | Line 2A & Line 2B","topStory":"false","publishDate":"2026-04-08T16:00:00.000+0000","updatedDate":"2026-08-14T13:32:47.000+0000","authorid":93416,"featuredImageUrl":"\u002Fimages\u002Fuploads\u002F2023\u002F4\u002Fyellow-line-mumbai-metro-2A.jpg","createdDate":"2022-11-14T07:31:59.000+0000","authorName":"Anuja Patil","authorURL":"authors\u002Fanuja-patil\u002F93416.html","domainName":"MBC","id":130113,"viewCount":123646,"category":14817,"excerpt":"The Mumbai Metro Yellow line is segmented into two parts, i.e. line 2A and 2B. The Line 2B has recently become partially operational.","permalink":"https:\u002F\u002Fcontent.magicbricks.com\u002Fcity-news\u002Fmumbai-mmr\u002Fyellow-line-metro-route-mumbai\u002F130113.html","slug":"yellow-line-metro-route-mumbai","subcategoryName":"Mumbai MMR","parentCategoryName":"City News","_version_":1875691294049697800,"url":"https:\u002F\u002Fwww.magicbricks.com\u002Fblog\u002Fyellow-line-metro-route-mumbai\u002F130113.html"},{"articleTitle":"Western Line Mumbai - Route, Map, Stations, Facilities, Fare & More","topStory":"false","publishDate":"2025-04-02T08:00:00.000+0000","updatedDate":"2026-01-14T20:50:30.000+0000","authorid":89013,"featuredImageUrl":"\u002Fimages\u002Fuploads\u002F2023\u002F2\u002Fwestern-line-Mumbai.jpg","createdDate":"2023-02-17T15:46:29.000+0000","authorName":"Nupur Saini","authorURL":"authors\u002Fnupur-saini\u002F89013.html","domainName":"MBC","id":131117,"viewCount":94992,"category":14817,"excerpt":"The local train network of Mumbai is the heart of the city. In this vast network, Western Line Mumbai is one of the most important railway lines. This blog provides a deeper look into this railway line. ","permalink":"https:\u002F\u002Fcontent.magicbricks.com\u002Fcity-news\u002Fmumbai-mmr\u002Fwestern-line-mumbai\u002F131117.html","slug":"western-line-mumbai","subcategoryName":"Mumbai MMR","parentCategoryName":"City News","_version_":1875691288705106000,"url":"https:\u002F\u002Fwww.magicbricks.com\u002Fblog\u002Fwestern-line-mumbai\u002F131117.html"}],"getrecentpost":[{"articleTitle":"Mumbai vs Bengaluru vs Delhi-NCR: Where Should HNIs Invest in Luxury Property?","topStory":"false","publishDate":"2026-08-26T15:03:00.000+0000","updatedDate":"2026-08-26T17:45:32.000+0000","authorid":107896,"featuredImageUrl":"\u002Fimages\u002Fuploads\u002F2026\u002F8\u002FFI-mumbai-vs-delhi-bengaluru.jpg","createdDate":"2026-08-26T15:32:05.000+0000","authorName":"Jyotsna Kumar","authorURL":"authors\u002Fjyotsna-kumar\u002F107896.html","domainName":"MBC","id":151181,"viewCount":93,"category":14843,"excerpt":"India's luxury housing market is set to nearly double by 2031 but not every city offers the same opportunity. Here's a real estate investment guide for HNIs in 2026 and why it matters.","permalink":"https:\u002F\u002Fcontent.magicbricks.com\u002Fresearch\u002Freal-estate-investments\u002Fwhich-city-should-hnis-invest-in-luxury-property-jymb\u002F151181.html","slug":"which-city-should-hnis-invest-in-luxury-property-jymb","subcategoryName":"Real Estate Investments","parentCategoryName":"Research","_version_":1875691316261683200,"url":"https:\u002F\u002Fwww.magicbricks.com\u002Fblog\u002Fwhich-city-should-hnis-invest-in-luxury-property-jymb\u002F151181.html"},{"articleTitle":"Ready Reckoner Rates in Mumbai 2026-27","topStory":"false","publishDate":"2026-08-26T04:00:00.000+0000","updatedDate":"2026-08-26T11:26:29.000+0000","authorid":82800,"featuredImageUrl":"\u002Fimages\u002Fuploads\u002F2021\u002F1\u002Frate